openmediavault-nextcloud (8.0.2) stable; urgency=medium

  * The data shared folder (mounted at /var/www/html inside the container)
    is dedicated to Nextcloud, so removing the previous data after a
    directory migration now clears the whole folder instead of only the
    Nextcloud sub-directories. The shared folder itself is kept.

